As I suspected, `inspect.unwrap` does not unwrap `functools.partial`.

If `self.call` is a `partial` object, `_unwrapped_call` will be the `partial` object.

Then `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(self._unwrapped_call)` will be `False`.
